{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537154, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42229, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788178932, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537154}, "__GROUPS": {"73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 877701716, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 66, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 14:29", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877701230,47288722,464]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-07 14:25):[/b]<br/><br/>[s:pg:转身]小图我感觉精神错乱了&amp;#160;&amp;#160;[/quote]<br/>我从来不去评价别人<br/>我只说我自己  我吹我自己就行了  别人怎么样不关我的事。<br/>对错我自己认。", "lou": 200, "content_length": 87, "reply_to": 877701230, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786084195}, {"pid": 877702713, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 62, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 14:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877702513,47288722,467]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60292634]arantir516[/uid] (2026-08-07 14:36):[/b]<br/><br/>昨天 3884不让下去，今天3930不让下去<br/>搞什么，高位逼人换筹码筑基？[/quote]<br/>那倒没有  就是大家怕踏空 跌了就赶紧买一点  就是这样了<br/>毕竟瞎的都知道GJD保哪个位置了。", "lou": 201, "content_length": 84, "reply_to": 877702513, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786084691}, {"pid": 877703480, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 78, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 14:44", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "呵呵[s:ac:反对]<br/>你们太菜了<br/>今天我一鱼三吃。[s:ac:心]", "lou": 202, "content_length": 26, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786085057}, {"pid": 877703953, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 66, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 14:48", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "哈哈  4吃！！！！", "lou": 203, "content_length": 15, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786085298}, {"pid": 877704260, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 71, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 14:51", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "OK  剩余10%仓位打入逆回购  结束今天所有操作。", "lou": 204, "content_length": 41, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786085466}, {"pid": 877709685, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 104, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 15:34", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "盘中交易都没整明白 去做盘后固定价格的交易？<br/>该不该说你们聪明呢", "lou": 205, "content_length": 60, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786088042}, {"pid": 877723848, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 143, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 17:29", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "虽然只有第一集，但是推荐个韩综<br/>《我剩下的恋爱》<br/><br/>如果真有看完的  再回顾一下自己七月历程，振作一下，这都不是事，没有什么过不去的", "lou": 206, "content_length": 122, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786094998}, {"pid": 877966775, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 192, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-10 12:28", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "今天就是指数第一次测试上方高点压力  <br/>正常走法都是冲高回落  所有板块  然后看GJD拉哪个位置<br/>所以今天我什么都不买。<br/>就是等。", "lou": 207, "content_length": 111, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786336132}, {"pid": 877970972, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 185, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-10 13:14", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "在冲击压力位的时候  放转缩量  券商和科技都没涨 用的是银行<br/>然后微小题材拉升<br/>没什么意思的时候  不买<br/>但凡买就是被套 <br/><br/>超短四个方向  医药吃完  电力吃了一半 航天下午如果还有冲高就吃一半  AI软没得吃就拿住<br/>吃出来的先拿现金 等回科技。", "lou": 208, "content_length": 204, "14": {"13": 1, "17": 1}, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786338879}, {"pid": 877971519, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 359, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-10 13:20", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "周末我心情不太好 所以就没来说<br/>为什么不好呢<br/>上次送我车的那个朋友去了大光，无视我的说法<br/>并且给我科普了他的PE理论<br/><br/>我只给他说了一个案例<br/>中远海控PE最低的时候。<br/><br/>我没想到给我科普科技基本面的不是你们  是我旁边的朋友<br/>最主要是真的拦不住。", "lou": 209, "content_length": 218, "14": {"15": 1, "17": 1}, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786339249}, {"pid": 878059851, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 194, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 11:09", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "截至目前 看不出哪个方向能有持续性<br/>倒是柚子抱团票很强  适合之前做超短的那种选手。什么抓龙头啊那种的。<br/>目前我在等上面画图。然后看看机构是怎么对待的。<br/>60%仓位持仓。<br/>发呆。", "lou": 210, "content_length": 161, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786417791}, {"pid": 878079742, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 162, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 14:18", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "看着眼睛还是睁开的  实际人已经睡过去两回了。[s:ac:凌乱]", "lou": 211, "content_length": 40, "14": {"13": 1}, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786429106}, {"pid": 878080251, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 36, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 14:23", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878080080,47288722,597]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65626456]晚上做噩梦[/uid] (2026-08-11 14:21):[/b]<br/><br/>话说回来，有什么推荐在一边打三角洲一边看的东西推荐么？比如说跑刀的时候推荐放点啥？经常找地方挂机回来发现脑袋被银翼拿枪指着[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>KPOP<br/>或者韩剧OST", "lou": 212, "content_length": 20, "reply_to": 878080080, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786429401}, {"pid": 878080437, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 85, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 14:25", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们居然吃到了个双跌停<br/>我今天晕死过去了  看盘都迟钝了。完全没有任何做票的激情。", "lou": 213, "content_length": 76, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786429510}, {"pid": 878080528, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 51, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 14:26", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878080170,47288722,597]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65162452]DeOrss[/uid] (2026-08-11 14:22):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，如果神秘力量不出手收了个光头阴是不是要考虑减仓了？[/quote]<br/>天天减？ 我哪有那么多仓位减。", "lou": 214, "content_length": 33, "reply_to": 878080170, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786429563}, {"pid": 878081060, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 57, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 14:30", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878080838,47288722,598]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60327779]言肆cyn[/uid] (2026-08-11 14:28):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大竟然也会用飞机战法吗 都冲晕了？[/quote]<br/>主要是无聊<br/>以我的能力看不出今天能做的机会。不是我能挣钱的行情。", "lou": 215, "content_length": 67, "reply_to": 878080838, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786429849}, {"pid": 878084127, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 111, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 14:57", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "现在是机构在测GJD保的位置到底是哪里<br/>今天看起来不是3950 那明天试试是不是还在3900", "lou": 216, "content_length": 77, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786431478}, {"pid": 878084750, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 62, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 15:03", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878084353,47288722,602]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67177520]Amam2haruna[/uid] (2026-08-11 14:59):[/b]<br/><br/>如果不是3900的话那就...直接开启4-5？[/quote]<br/><br/>那就继续震荡 反正3800肯定有<br/>4-4就结束不了", "lou": 217, "content_length": 44, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 878084353, "postdatetimestamp": 1786431808}, {"pid": 878084856, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 94, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 15:04", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "没有机会就发呆就好了 不是每一个波动都要吃满的", "lou": 218, "content_length": 44, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786431869}, {"pid": 878086066, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 17, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 15:14", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878085114,47288722,603]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66873750]亢亢emo拉[/uid] (2026-08-11 15:06):[/b]<br/><br/>KPOP 这活动我们公司经常举办，看腻了[/quote]<br/><br/>你说的是啥表演？不会是随舞吧<br/><br/>KPOP是听不腻的", "lou": 219, "content_length": 47, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 878085114, "postdatetimestamp": 1786432483}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283296, "replies": 37097, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1788251595, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "kaleColourWgw", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1788251595, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1788251328, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"1